	// Foyer ships no credential: the first administrator is created by
	// `completeAdminSetup` with a password of their own choosing, so a fresh
	// install never sets this. It is set only by
	// `foyerctl create-operator --must-change-password` — the host-side recovery
	// path, for an operator whose password was issued by somebody else — and it
	// is `required` rather than optional because a client that cannot see the
	// state cannot route to it, and a client that treats it as absent renders a
	// console the server will refuse every call from.
