	// an OpenAPI description reads as a reference to a schema in this document, and
	// it is copied verbatim into `src/generated/types.ts` and into
	// `internal/api/gen/server.gen.go`, where a reader has even less to go on. No
	// `$ref` resolver will ever check it; the guard that does sits beside the orphan
	// check in `web/mock/src/validate.test.ts`.
