	// downscaled to 900 px, the macOS CNA's full window width, is 89,697 B at
	// JPEG q70. Base64 inflates it by a third and gzip gives back exactly that,
	// so as a data URI it costs *more than the raw file* and lands at 1.75× the
	// entire document budget. Inlined, the guest waits for the whole photograph
	// before seeing a word; linked, the document renders at 4 kB and the image
	// arrives after — which is the right order on a link with no default route.
	//
	// The path is same-origin because the portal's FQDN is already inside the
	// walled garden by requirement. `docs/rules/security.md` §5,
	// `docs/protocol-reality.md`.
